          "source": "history",
          "bulletin": "84c32f4a1e95",
          "said": "weekly adoration Friday 15:00 first, 'in the chapel; includes Benediction'"
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "Both bulletins state the standing pattern: 1st Friday of each month, 3pm, in the chapel, with Exposition and Benediction. Weeks-of-the-month slots are weekly per the policy. The chapel is read as the parish church's own chapel (the Contemplative Prayer Group also meets 'in the chapel' or on 'the church patio'); no other address is given. 'Holy Hour' alone is not a stated duration, so end_time is left null. Caveat: the 'next one' dates printed are October 4 (a Sunday) and November 5 (a Thursday), neither a first Friday (Oct 2, Nov 6); they look like stale or mistyped dates rather than a change of day, so no dated entry is added. History's older run read the Oct 4 note as a move; that date is past anyway.",
